    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20ec1658ba80d8bc4d334248",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "──君临今年“橡树大赛”的是！\n“华丽一族”第一红宝石！\n她漂亮地替母亲雪耻了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "97858dd9f4cd9582c98b9c9df283e63710ae51916d8b620d4a36b0eb9b1f80c3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
