    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d47aaa913a317e0ddc3b6fce",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "第一红宝石顺利跑完2400米比赛，并且获胜。\n然而……我的疑虑不仅没有消除，\n反而更趋向肯定。",
      "source_fingerprint": "70bc1b2b48bf10d951e641d29e61eaa61feabc298e2f570482d86cf5afcf67ad",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085307.json",
      "json_path": [
