        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/31/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5cfb93037e472b7e1e25c264",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "从今天那让人看得七上八下的表现，\n以及赛后的强烈疲劳，能确定她在\n“赛马娘赛”展现的速度才是她的本领──",
      "source_fingerprint": "62e010eae8a5709e573151935fa23947127d82af13b2c98a2b4753915c2c9da9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
